{"id":"21d26179073d0cb7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/561_动态拓扑逻辑.md","title":"561 动态拓扑逻辑","display":"561_动态拓扑逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{next}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{next}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A,\\bigcirc A\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A,\\bigcirc A\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\operatorname{next}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与替换\">3. 自由变元、绑定与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题变元函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\bigcirc A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\bigcirc A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{561}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,561}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{561}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,561}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{561}=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{561}=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{561})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{561})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\\)</span>，替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\bigcirc A,\\sigma)=\\bigcirc\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\bigcirc A,\\sigma)=\\bigcirc\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{561}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{561}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{561}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{561}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{561}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{561}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>拓扑框公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>动态下一步公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\bigcirc}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\bigcirc(A\\to B)\\to(\\bigcirc A\\to\\bigcirc B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\bigcirc}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\bigcirc(A\\to B)\\to(\\bigcirc A\\to\\bigcirc B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg\\bigcirc}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\bigcirc\\neg A\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\bigcirc A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg\\bigcirc}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\bigcirc\\neg A\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\bigcirc A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>连续性交互公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Cont}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\bigcirc\\Box A\\to\\Box\\bigcirc A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Cont}^{561}\n=\n\\{\\bigcirc\\Box A\\to\\Box\\bigcirc A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{561}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{561}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{561}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\bigcirc}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg\\bigcirc}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Cont}^{561}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{561}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{561}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{561}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\bigcirc}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg\\bigcirc}^{561}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Cont}^{561}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{561}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{561}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561}\n=\n\\{((A),\\bigcirc A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{561}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561}\n=\n\\{((A),\\bigcirc A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>两个必然化规则都只允许从空依赖行使用。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{561}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{561}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{561}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{561}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{561}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{561}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{561}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{561}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{561}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{561}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\text{ 使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{561}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{561}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\text{ 使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{561}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{561}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{561}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{561}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-动态证明证书\">8. 动态证明证书</h1>\n<p>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"561\">\\(561\\)</span>-证明证书是五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\pi,A,\\Delta,\\rho)\">\\((\\Gamma,\\pi,A,\\Delta,\\rho)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{561}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{561}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 的末行为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta,A)\">\\((\\Delta,A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 记录每一行属于假设、公理、MP、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 必然化或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcirc\">\\(\\bigcirc\\)</span> 必然化。证书合法当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 的每个条目满足第 6 节的对应条件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-动态拓扑语义载体与后承\">9. 动态拓扑语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>定义拓扑条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Top}_{561}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{Top}_{561}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in\\tau,\\quad X\\in\\tau,\\quad U,V\\in\\tau\\Rightarrow U\\cap V\\in\\tau,\\quad \\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\in\\tau,\\quad X\\in\\tau,\\quad U,V\\in\\tau\\Rightarrow U\\cap V\\in\\tau,\\quad \\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>连续性谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cont}_{561}(X,\\tau,f)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nf:X\\to X\\ \\wedge\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\{x\\in X:f(x)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cont}_{561}(X,\\tau,f)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nf:X\\to X\\ \\wedge\\ \\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\{x\\in X:f(x)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>动态拓扑模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,f,V):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X),\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{561}(X,\\tau),\\ \\operatorname{Cont}_{561}(X,\\tau,f),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,f,V):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X),\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{561}(X,\\tau),\\ \\operatorname{Cont}_{561}(X,\\tau,f),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义内部算子的依赖域</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,Y):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{561}(X,\\tau),\\ Y\\subseteq X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561}\n=\n\\{(X,\\tau,Y):X\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\operatorname{Top}_{561}(X,\\tau),\\ Y\\subseteq X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全局内部算子定义为函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}_{561}:\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561}\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{(X,\\tau,Y)\\in\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561}}\\mathcal P(X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Int}_{561}:\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561}\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{(X,\\tau,Y)\\in\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561}}\\mathcal P(X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}_{561}(X,\\tau,Y)=\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq Y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Int}_{561}(X,\\tau,Y)=\\bigcup\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq Y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(X,\\tau,f,V)\\in\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561}\">\\(M=(X,\\tau,f,V)\\in\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{561}=\\{y\\in X:M,y\\models_{561}A\\}\">\\(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{561}=\\{y\\in X:M,y\\models_{561}A\\}\\)</span>，并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{561}p\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,x\\not\\models_{561}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{561}p\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,x\\not\\models_{561}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{561}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,x\\models_{561}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{561}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(M,x\\models_{561}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{561}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,x\\models_{561}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,x\\models_{561}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{561}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,x\\models_{561}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,x\\models_{561}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{561}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nx\\in\\operatorname{Int}_{561}(X,\\tau,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{561}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{561}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nx\\in\\operatorname{Int}_{561}(X,\\tau,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_M^{561}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{561}\\bigcirc A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,f(x)\\models_{561}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,x\\models_{561}\\bigcirc A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,f(x)\\models_{561}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{561}^{\\mathsf{dtop}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{561}^{\\mathsf{dtop}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(X,\\tau,f,V)\\in\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561}\">\\(M=(X,\\tau,f,V)\\in\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,x\\models_{561}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,x\\models_{561}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,x\\models_{561}A\">\\(M,x\\models_{561}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目在拓扑模态逻辑的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 上新增原始动态构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcirc\">\\(\\bigcirc\\)</span>，并加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Cont}^{561}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Cont}^{561}\\)</span>。它不同于第 560 条，因为第 560 条没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}\">\\(\\operatorname{next}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561}\\)</span> 或连续性交互公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{DTL}_{561}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{561},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{561},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{561},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{561},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,561},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{561},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{561},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{561},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{561},\n\\vdash_{561},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Top}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Cont}_{561},\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Int}_{561},\n\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561},\n\\models_{561},\n\\models_{561}^{\\mathsf{dtop}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{DTL}_{561}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{561},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{561},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{561},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{561},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,561},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{561},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{561},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{561},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\bigcirc}^{561},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{561},\n\\vdash_{561},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Top}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Cont}_{561},\n\\mathsf{IntDom}_{561},\n\\operatorname{Int}_{561},\n\\mathsf{DTopMod}_{561},\n\\models_{561},\n\\models_{561}^{\\mathsf{dtop}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含动态拓扑逻辑的句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、拓扑空间、连续自映射语义和语义后承；不含可靠性证明、完备性证明或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与替换","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-动态证明证书","text":"8. 动态证明证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-动态拓扑语义载体与后承","text":"9. 动态拓扑语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\n=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{next}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A,\\bigcirc A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{next}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(\\bigcirc A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{561}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,561}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{561}=\\operatorname{PV}_{561}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{561}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{561})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{561}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{561}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A,\\sigma),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{561}(A\\to